**HEALTH FIELDS**

*"**Organic By Nature**"** | Established 2003*

BRAND BIBLE v2.0 | Brahhm Arpan Organic Pvt. Ltd.

**1. BRAND FOUNDATION**

**Origin Story**

Health Fields is the original flagship brand of Brahhm Arpan Organic Pvt. Ltd., established in 2003 — over two decades of organic food experience. It holds fully organic status per APEDA standards, certified by USOCA (APEDA-accredited), and is available across major retailers and online marketplaces across India.

**Mission Statement**

By providing high-quality, farm-fresh organic goods, to add value to customers' expectations — making certified organic food accessible, trustworthy, and nourishing for every Indian family.

**Certifications**

• USDA Organic

• Jaivik Bharat

• FSSAI

• India Organic

• Suitable for Vegetarian (certified)

• USOCA certified (APEDA-accredited)

**Sub-brand: Rozana**

Rozana (रोज़ाना — "everyday" in Hindi) is the everyday wellness sub-brand under Health Fields. Positioned for the health-conscious consumer who makes organic choices part of their daily routine.

• ROZANA VOICE: Slightly warmer than main brand. Daily habit angle. Routine-building energy.

• ROZANA vs HF: HF = heritage authority. Rozana = daily ritual companion.

• Current Rozana Hero: Forest Honey ₹490 — in stock. Morning immunity ritual angle.

| **⚠ ROZANA ACV — OUT OF STOCK** Rozana Apple Cider Vinegar 750ml (₹599) is currently OUT OF STOCK. Do not create posts for this product. When it returns to stock, it becomes the lead Rozana conversion product (highest value, strongest daily ritual hook). |
