**Priority Tier 1 — Post Most Often**

**Herbal Tea Range (₹215–₹230) — UNTAPPED OPPORTUNITY**

8 in-stock SKUs with zero content history. Massive gap. Each tea has its own functional angle.

• Calming Chamomile — sleep, stress relief, evening ritual

• Dream Infusion — caffeine-free bedtime, parents and wellness seekers

• Her Health Herbal Infusion — women's health, hormonal wellness

• Liv Detox (Milk Thistle & Dandelion) — liver support, detox ritual

• Tulsi Green Tea (3 variants: Premium, Select, Lemon Ginger) — immunity, energy

• Tummy Relax — digestive wellness, post-meal ritual

• Slimcut Green Tea — metabolism, weight management angle

Content angle: "The cup that does more than wake you up." Morning/evening ritual. Rozana voice.

**Millets ****&**** Flours**

Strong educational content opportunity. Ancient grain heritage. Browntop Millet ₹570 is the premium SKU.

• Millets → Ancient grain education, nutrition comparison, cooking tutorials

• Flours → Recipe content, roti/bread making, gluten-free angle

**Pulses ****&**** Spices**

Volume drivers. Everyday staples. Recipe-led content. Community content.

**Priority Tier 2 — Post Regularly**

**Oils, Seeds ****&**** Nuts, Sugar ****&**** Salt**

Clean label posts. Comparison with conventional versions. Certification angle.

**Priority Tier 3 — Post Occasionally**

**Wellness Category**

Rozana Forest Honey ₹490 is the current Rozana hero. Morning immunity ritual. Pair with tea range.

**The ****"****Since 2003****"**** Content Bank**

Make the 20-year claim concrete, not decorative. Use specific facts:

• "We've been certified organic since before most current brands existed."

• "20 years of the same standard. Not trends. Standards."

• "250+ quality tests. Every batch. Since 2003."

• APEDA certification journey — one of the first in India

• "20 years before Label Padhega India was a movement, we were already listing every ingredient."

